msgstr "Year Forty"

#. Key:	Lore.12.Author
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Lore.ST_Lore
#: /Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Lore.ST_Lore
msgctxt "ST_Lore,Lore.12.Author"
msgid "Helios-Nadir, asset department"
msgstr "Helios-Nadir, asset department"

#. Key:	Lore.12.Body
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Lore.ST_Lore
#: /Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Lore.ST_Lore
msgctxt "ST_Lore,Lore.12.Body"
msgid "To orbital control. Subject: recovery of Ark Hollow assets. The Ark's return was projected within a four per cent margin. Priority: Aether cores, intact. Crew records and anomalous tissue: secondary assets. Handlers Vector-1 to Vector-8 have been decommissioned after prolonged exposure to Ark transmissions (see incident file: voices on the handler channel). Vector-9 is to address contractors in text only. Contractor losses within projected figures are acceptable and need not be reported. This memo is not to be shared with contractors."
msgstr "To orbital control. Subject: recovery of Ark Hollow assets. The Ark's return was projected within a four per cent margin. Priority: Aether cores, intact. Crew records and anomalous tissue: secondary assets. Handlers Vector-1 to Vector-8 have been decommissioned after prolonged exposure to Ark transmissions (see incident file: voices on the handler channel). Vector-9 is to address contractors in text only. Contractor losses within projected figures are acceptable and need not be reported. This memo is not to be shared with contractors."

#. Key:	Lore.12.Stamp
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Lore.ST_Lore
#: /Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Lore.ST_Lore
