#. Key:	Altar.Started.1.1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
#: /Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
msgctxt "ST_Radio,Altar.Started.1.1"
msgid "Ritual's running. The whole cathedral heard that. Hold the altar."
msgstr "Ritual's running. The whole cathedral heard that. Hold the altar."

#. Key:	Altar.Started.2.1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
#: /Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
msgctxt "ST_Radio,Altar.Started.2.1"
msgid "Purification started. Keep them off the altar until the hum settles."
msgstr "Purification started. Keep them off the altar until the hum settles."

#. Key:	Core.Lifted.1.1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
#: /Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
msgctxt "ST_Radio,Core.Lifted.1.1"
msgid "Core is moving. From here on, every step you take costs the company money. Make them count."
msgstr "Core is moving. From here on, every step you take costs the company money. Make them count."

#. Key:	Core.Lifted.2.1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
#: /Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
msgctxt "ST_Radio,Core.Lifted.2.1"
msgid "You've got it. Slow and steady to extraction. Drop it and I'll hear about it. So will they."
msgstr "You've got it. Slow and steady to extraction. Drop it and I'll hear about it. So will they."

#. Key:	Core.Lifted.3.1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
#: /Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
msgctxt "ST_Radio,Core.Lifted.3.1"
msgid "Core lifted. Your Resonance will climb. That's not a malfunction, that's the job."
msgstr "Core lifted. Your Resonance will climb. That's not a malfunction, that's the job."

#. Key:	Core.Sighted.1.1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
#: /Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
msgctxt "ST_Radio,Core.Sighted.1.1"
msgid "Core signature confirmed. That's the one Helios-Nadir is paying for."
msgstr "Core signature confirmed. That's the one Helios-Nadir is paying for."

#. Key:	Core.Sighted.2.1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
#: /Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
msgctxt "ST_Radio,Core.Sighted.2.1"
msgid "I see the core on your helmet feed. Beautiful. Don't scratch it."
msgstr "I see the core on your helmet feed. Beautiful. Don't scratch it."

#. Key:	Core.Sighted.3.1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
#: /Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
msgctxt "ST_Radio,Core.Sighted.3.1"
msgid "Aether core in sight. It's heavy and it hums. Things down there like the hum."
msgstr "Aether core in sight. It's heavy and it hums. Things down there like the hum."

#. Key:	Extraction.Started.1.1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
#: /Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
msgctxt "ST_Radio,Extraction.Started.1.1"
msgid "The Skiff is counting down. Everyone into the zone, cores aboard. I don't pay for stragglers."
msgstr "The Skiff is counting down. Everyone into the zone, cores aboard. I don't pay for stragglers."

#. Key:	Extraction.Started.2.1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
#: /Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
msgctxt "ST_Radio,Extraction.Started.2.1"
msgid "Extraction is live. The Skiff leaves on time, with or without you."
msgstr "Extraction is live. The Skiff leaves on time, with or without you."

#. Key:	Extraction.Started.3.1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
#: /Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
msgctxt "ST_Radio,Extraction.Started.3.1"
msgid "Countdown's running. Whatever's in the zone at zero flies home. Whatever isn't, stays."
msgstr "Countdown's running. Whatever's in the zone at zero flies home. Whatever isn't, stays."

#. Key:	Hub.Briefing.1.1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
#: /Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
msgctxt "ST_Radio,Hub.Briefing.1.1"
msgid "Contractor, this is Vector-9, Helios-Nadir orbital control. Your contract is in force as of now."
msgstr "Contractor, this is Vector-9, Helios-Nadir orbital control. Your contract is in force as of now."

#. Key:	Hub.Briefing.1.2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
#: /Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
msgctxt "ST_Radio,Hub.Briefing.1.2"
msgid "Below you is the Ark Hollow. Gone for forty years, back without a living soul. Its Aether cores are still warm."
msgstr "Below you is the Ark Hollow. Gone for forty years, back without a living soul. Its Aether cores are still warm."

#. Key:	Hub.Briefing.1.3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
#: /Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
msgctxt "ST_Radio,Hub.Briefing.1.3"
msgid "Take a contract at the cockpit console. The workbench and the locker are along the hull. Insure what you can't lose."
msgstr "Take a contract at the cockpit console. The workbench and the locker are along the hull. Insure what you can't lose."

#. Key:	Hub.Briefing.1.4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
#: /Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
msgctxt "ST_Radio,Hub.Briefing.1.4"
msgid "Bring the cores aboard the Skiff. The contract covers your life. It does not cover the cores."
msgstr "Bring the cores aboard the Skiff. The contract covers your life. It does not cover the cores."

#. Key:	Lore.First.1.1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
#: /Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
msgctxt "ST_Radio,Lore.First.1.1"
msgid "Crew records? Helios-Nadir pays for those too. Extract, and the bonus is yours."
msgstr "Crew records? Helios-Nadir pays for those too. Extract, and the bonus is yours."

#. Key:	Resonance.Critical.1.1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
#: /Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
msgctxt "ST_Radio,Resonance.Critical.1.1"
msgid "Your Resonance is critical. You're a beacon now. Everything down there knows where you are."
msgstr "Your Resonance is critical. You're a beacon now. Everything down there knows where you are."

#. Key:	Resonance.Critical.2.1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
#: /Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
msgctxt "ST_Radio,Resonance.Critical.2.1"
msgid "Resonance off the scale, and your feed is breaking up. Shed the noise, or shed the core."
msgstr "Resonance off the scale, and your feed is breaking up. Shed the noise, or shed the core."

#. Key:	Resonance.Critical.3.1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
#: /Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
msgctxt "ST_Radio,Resonance.Critical.3.1"
msgid "Critical Resonance. Your contract has a clause for this. You won't like it."
msgstr "Critical Resonance. Your contract has a clause for this. You won't like it."

#. Key:	Sortie.Cathedral.1.1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
#: /Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
msgctxt "ST_Radio,Sortie.Cathedral.1.1"
msgid "Reactor Cathedral, sector two. The crew prayed to the reactor here. Judging by the readings, something answered."
msgstr "Reactor Cathedral, sector two. The crew prayed to the reactor here. Judging by the readings, something answered."

#. Key:	Sortie.Cathedral.1.2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
#: /Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
msgctxt "ST_Radio,Sortie.Cathedral.1.2"
msgid "The altar purifies a core, and a pure one pays more. The ritual is loud. Hold the altar until it's done."
msgstr "The altar purifies a core, and a pure one pays more. The ritual is loud. Hold the altar until it's done."

#. Key:	Sortie.Docks.1.1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
#: /Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
msgctxt "ST_Radio,Sortie.Docks.1.1"
msgid "Orbital Docks, sector one. The airlocks were sealed from the inside. Whoever sealed them may still be on watch."
msgstr "Orbital Docks, sector one. The airlocks were sealed from the inside. Whoever sealed them may still be on watch."

#. Key:	Sortie.Docks.1.2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
#: /Game/Hollow/Localization/ST_Radio.ST_Radio
msgctxt "ST_Radio,Sortie.Docks.1.2"
msgid "Find the vault, take the core, get back to the extraction zone. Keep the chatter down: the ship listens."
msgstr "Find the vault, take the core, get back to the extraction zone. Keep the chatter down: the ship listens."

#. Key:	Speaker.Echo
